Package: biocroxytest
Title: Generate Ordinary and Long Tests for Bioconductor Packages
Version: 1.9.1
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Francesc",
             family = "Catala-Moll",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "fcatala@irsicaixa.es",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2354-8648"))
    )
Description: Generates ordinary and long 'testthat' tests from 'roxygen2'
    tags in package source files. Ordinary tests are included in the regular
    package check. Long tests can be run separately, including on the
    Bioconductor build system. The ordinary test filename prefix is compatible
    with 'roxytest'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE, roclets = c("rd", "collate", "namespace"))
URL: https://github.com/xec-cm/biocroxytest,
    https://xec-cm.github.io/biocroxytest/
BugReports: https://github.com/xec-cm/biocroxytest/issues
